# npu-chat — fullscreen chat UI for the QCS6490 Hexagon NPU (V68).
#
# Talks to genie-t2t-run from the npu-llm package. One process per turn: the
# model reload costs ~1.2 s, the rest is generation. genie-t2t-run prints each
# token as it lands, but stdio is fully buffered when stdout is a pipe, so it
# runs under `stdbuf -o0` and the reader thread mirrors the text into the bubble
# as it arrives.

